 "I let myself be swayed, without even resisting,"}, {"beat": 172, "text": "I\u2019m the puppet dancing to their persistent twisting."}, {"beat": 180, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "I let myself be swayed, oh yes, I\u2019m so hooked,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "By all these smooth talkers who spin tales that are cooked."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "I let myself be swayed, without even knowing,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "That I\u2019m the gullible one, always end up losing."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}